{"id":"644942","name":"山药磨牙棒","author":"伊悠悠","authorId":"230225","desc":"","cover":"images/644942/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"山药泥","amount":"80g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋黄","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"山药去皮切块蒸锅蒸熟。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/01/05/202301051672930935641896230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"山药压成泥，取了80克，面粉100克，蛋黄一个。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/01/05/202301051672930941249611230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"不用加水，揉成光滑面团（好粘可以适量加些面粉）。盖盖，醒10分钟。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/01/05/202301051672930950301593230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"案板撒面粉，擀面团成长方形。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/01/05/202301051672930971279262230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"均匀切片。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/01/05/202301051672930977398199230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"两头朝不同方向旋转，放入烤盘。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/01/05/202301051672930983727933230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"度全火烤25分钟。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/01/05/202301051672930990158218230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"冷却，密封保存。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2023/01/05/202301051672930997578500230225.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}